    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Manase was sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manase abeeda gaba gweanyeew damaniyeenya damanda ang'eada gheambalmeedean, hean goombaliischi gweanyeew haradam ea damanamuut aba Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin riing'eeda aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, gawuurji munyasnacheeka eemoojiga ghayi aruuteawa NG'UTAMIIDA madeeda fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gabiikta ghwadeas heetiyeada ghayi nyarjeawi ghwaan was Hesekiya, ak ghwayiin Baali heeda wagiida, gwasin Asherajeega, ak ghabwat shirikarajeega sean bea humng'eeda, ak gagadiiyeesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwadeas heeda wagiida aba jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, bea gida ghayi eeshinda NG'UTAMIIDA, “Yerusalemu gaygwanda gheawungeasu damanda manda muudeanooda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwadeas heeda wagiida bea shirikarajeega sean bea humng'eeda aba jeeda doodoonung'weaka iyeenya bea gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghaghwarda orjoagaaschi ghoah haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi aba jeeda moangoachiyda orjeeda Hinomu, aba ng'ata ghabwar lagheanga, ak gwasin beeneetkweanduumeeda, ea giijoocheanduumeeda ea fuga ang'urooni buuneeda. Hean gwasin muuchi riing'eeda aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ghwanung' ghwanyareas niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwayiin sanaamooda sin jeeda gheeda ASEETA, ghayi eesha ASEETA Dawdi ea orjeedaanyi was Sulemani, “Aba jeedeaba gheawi, ea aba Yerusalemu, ghayi naaloachi aba jeeda eemoojiga sean bea Israeli, gaydamiinda gheawungeasu damanda manda muudeanooda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ea maygudu daang'aamwa geeshanga fuga Israeli jeeda ng'eanyiida ghayi naadawji ghweaniga nyaawa, inyas gayghoang'waay gida ghayi earukusi, bea diigheanyeeka sean, ea deaweedajeega, ea huumeanyeeka ghayi aadawji aba geatinga Musa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwanung' Manase gwasin ramaseanda fuga Yuda sea fuga abiita Yerusalemu, hean gwasin riing'eeda ea ghwanaawa eemoojiga ghayi huuyda NG'UTAMIIDA aba madeeda fuga Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Manase gwaduukuuna",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goobalool NG'UTAMIIDA Manase sea fugaaschi, hean ea mooleeysiina iita saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goojeagu NG'UTAMIIDA heanyaawa shirikarajeega lugooda sugoocheanda Ashuru, ak ghoang'waayi Manase aba sidageenga gwaneadi ak ghwarat aba munyooloalajeega gharinga ak geayaat Babeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean aba jeeda sawanaduutkaaschi ghoapkaat alooheeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANYI ak ghwaat geaw ng'eanyi aba madeeda ASEETA ghweanigaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghamwaash niny, ak ghwayiiy ASEETA musiischoadaanyi aba ng'ata goodeelu Yerusalemu gicha jeeda gheambalmeadaanyi. Hean gwajeeng'u Manase gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA ASEETA gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba ng'ata ghwadeas ghamarda jarooda bea mujiineeda Dawdi mida dirbeayda Gihoni, aba mwaangwaachi gwahisa Gidaghuusiga Ghweayeega, ak gooneaweesa Ofeli, ak gagatkat ea gageawiit muuchi; aba ng'ata ghwayiin shirikarajeega lugooda jeeda mujiinajeega sineaweesa hilooga bea Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gageanda aseecheeka eemoojiga ea sanaamooda leabu jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ea heeda wagiida ghayi sin aba uhuuda giijeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea Yerusalemu, ak gwajakteawa jeeda mujiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gabiikta ghwadeas heeda wagiida bea NG'UTAMIIDA ak ghoadaydaawa badaydaanyi lukghumajeega bea haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea hoyyoo ea gea badiischooda, ak ghoadaw diigheanda fuga Yuda gideaba gaygagadiyeesa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak buuneeda gagutkuta ghwayiin lukghumajeega heetiyeada nea saawa ghoadaw NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Muudeanooda gheambalmeeda Manase",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gadiyoojiga mwaatkwa bea Manase, ea musiischoadaanyi aba heeda ASEATAANYI, ea ng'asheega rukusa meang'nyeanda niny aba gheawunga NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA Israeli, ng'ula gwanda jeeda damanyoojiga sugoodiga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak musiischoadaanyi ea gida shaayda ghuutaanyi ASEETA, ea riing'eagaaschi sean ea ramaseanyeakaaschi ea heeda deeksa heetiyeada ak ghwayiin Asherimu ea sanaamajeega sisin, gheata mii ghwaat geaw ng'eanyi, ng'ula geeng'oorsa jeeda damanyoojiga meanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghami Manase, ak geebung'sa jeedeaba gheanyi; ak gawa hoorgeadaanyi goombaliischi baleandaanyi siguura Amoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amoni sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amoni abeeda gaba gweanyeew diktam ea iyeenya damanda ang'eada gheambalmeedean, ak goombaliischi gweanyeew iyeenya aba Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin ng'asheega munyas aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, gawuurji gidasin ghweanda siguura Manase. Amoni gwasissa lukghumajeega sanaamajeega ghayi sin ghwaan, ak gagadiiyeesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak niny ea mwaada geaw ng'eanyi aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA gawuurji gida aata geaw ng'eanyi Manaseyda was ghwaan, ak Amoni niny ghoahaat ramaseanyeeka saang'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalaabwa bwadaw fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda ak geenuuksa jeedeaba gheanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak fuga bea ng'eanyiida ghwalajaada gheatkweaka fuga sean laabwa bwadaw sugoocheanda was Amoni; ak ghwanung' fuga bea ng'eanyiida gawa hoorgeadaanyi goombaliischi orjeedaanyi was Yosiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
